{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你們當在耶路撒冷的街上跑來跑去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在寬闊處尋找，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看有一人行公義求誠實沒有？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若有，我就赦免這城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的人雖然指着永生的耶和華起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所起的誓實在是假的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你的眼目不是看顧誠實嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你擊打他們，他們卻不傷慟；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你毀滅他們，他們仍不受懲治。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們使臉剛硬過於磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不肯回頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我說：這些人實在是貧窮的，是愚昧的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為不曉得耶和華的作為","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和他們上帝的法則。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要去見尊大的人，對他們說話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們曉得耶和華的作為","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和他們上帝的法則。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哪知，這些人齊心將軛折斷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掙開繩索。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"因此，林中的獅子必害死他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"晚上","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"的豺狼必滅絕他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豹子要在城外窺伺他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡出城的必被撕碎；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們的罪過極多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背道的事也加增了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"我怎能赦免你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的兒女離棄我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又指着那不是神的起誓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使他們飽足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們就行姦淫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成群地聚集在娼妓家裏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們像餵飽的馬到處亂跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各向他鄰舍的妻發嘶聲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：我豈不因這些事討罪呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈不報復這樣的國民呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要上她葡萄園的牆施行毀壞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不可毀壞淨盡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只可除掉她的枝子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為不屬耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"原來以色列家和猶大家大行詭詐攻擊我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華丟棄以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"他們不認耶和華，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這並不是他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"災禍必不臨到我們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀劍和饑荒，我們也看不見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知的話必成為風；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"道也不在他們裏面。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這災必臨到他們身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"所以耶和華－萬軍之上帝如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為百姓說這話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使我的話在你口中為火，使他們為柴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這火便將他們燒滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：以色列家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使一國的民從遠方來攻擊你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是強盛的國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是從古而有的國。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的言語你不曉得，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的話你不明白。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的箭袋是敞開的墳墓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都是勇士。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必吃盡你的莊稼和你的糧食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你兒女該吃的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必吃盡你的牛羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃盡你的葡萄和無花果；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又必用刀毀壞你所倚靠的堅固城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶和華說：「就是到那時，我也不將你們毀滅淨盡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["百姓若說：『耶和華－我們的上帝為甚麼向我們行這一切事呢？』你就對他們說：『你們怎樣離棄耶和華",{"noteId":7},"，在你們的地上事奉外邦神，也必照樣在不屬你們的地上事奉外邦人。』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝警告他的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"當傳揚在雅各家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報告在猶大說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愚昧無知的百姓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們有眼不看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有耳不聽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在當聽這話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：你們怎麼不懼怕我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我以永遠的定例，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用沙為海的界限，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水不得越過。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你們在我面前還不戰兢嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"波浪雖然翻騰，卻不能逾越；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然匉訇，卻不能過去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但這百姓有背叛忤逆的心；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們叛我而去，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心內也不說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們應當敬畏耶和華－我們的上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他按時賜雨，就是秋雨春雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又為我們定收割的節令，永存不廢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的罪孽使這些事轉離你們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的罪惡使你們不能得福。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為在我民中有惡人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們埋伏窺探，好像捕鳥的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們設立圈套陷害人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"籠內怎樣滿了雀鳥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的房中也照樣充滿詭詐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以他們得成為大，而且富足。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們肥胖光潤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作惡過甚，不為人伸冤！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是不為孤兒伸冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不使他亨通，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不為窮人辨屈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：我豈不因這些事討罪呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈不報復這樣的國民呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"國中有可驚駭、可憎惡的事：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是先知說假預言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司藉他們把持權柄；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓也喜愛這些事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到了結局你們怎樣行呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：野地","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":6}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"原文是我","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":19}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}